{"sha": "056bcffd250b2d01dfbbf9f4bf2fde8ae6acf6fac2dca5118704552aaa418570", "body": ["\\chapter{测量}\\label{ch:g3:measure}", "", "有多长？有多重？能装多少？几点了？测量", "能把世界变成数字 --- 前提是大家使用相同的单位。", "本章介绍长度、质量和容积的单位，", "并教你如何读钟表。", "", "\\section{长度}", "", "\\begin{definition}[长度单位]\\label{def:g3:measure:length}", "长度的基本单位是\\emph{米}（m）。较小的长度用", "厘米（cm）和毫米（mm）；较长的距离用", "千米（km）。", "\\[", "1 \\text{ 米} = 100 \\text{ 厘米}, \\qquad", "1 \\text{ 厘米} = 10 \\text{ 毫米}, \\qquad", "1 \\text{ 千米} = 1\\,000 \\text{ 米}.", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.3]", "  % ruler body extends past the marks so no numeral is clipped", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.35,0) rectangle (8.35,0.9);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,8} {", "    \\draw[thick] (\\i,0.9) -- (\\i,0.55);", "    \\node[font=\\small] at (\\i,0.32) {\\i};", "  }", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,80} \\draw (\\i*0.1,0.9) -- (\\i*0.1,0.72);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (0,1.25) -- (3.6,1.25);", "  \\node[omThm, above, font=\\small] at (1.8,1.3)", "    {$3.6$ 厘米 $= 3$ 厘米和 $6$ 毫米};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 读尺子：大刻度表示厘米，小刻度表示", "毫米。物体应从 $0$ 刻度开始 --- 而不是从", "尺子的边缘开始！ --- 终点在第 $6$ 个小刻度，位于 $3$ 之后。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[选择合适的单位]\\label{ex:g3:measure:choose}", "一只蚂蚁：约 $5$ 毫米。一支铅笔：约 $18$ 厘米。一扇门：约 $2$ 米。", "走到下一个村庄：约 $3$ 千米。说“铅笔的长度是", "$18$”毫无意义 --- 单位是答案的一部分。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[单位换算]\\label{met:g3:measure:convert}", "换算时，乘以或除以 $10$、$100$ 或 $1\\,000$：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由大单位换成小单位，\\emph{乘}：", "        $3$ 米 $= 3 \\times 100 = 300$ 厘米；", "  \\item 由小单位换成大单位，\\emph{除}：", "        $250$ 厘米 $= 250 \\div 100 = 2$ 米 和 $50$ 厘米；", "  \\item 要把长度相加，须先将它们换算成\\emph{相同}的单位：", "        $1$ 米 $+ 35$ 厘米 $= 100 + 35 = 135$ 厘米。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{质量和容积}", "", "\\begin{definition}[质量和容积的单位]\\label{def:g3:measure:mass}", "质量用\\emph{克}（g）和\\emph{千克}（kg）计量，", "容积（即容器所能容纳的量）用\\emph{升}（L）和", "\\emph{厘升}（cL）计量：", "\\[", "1 \\text{ 千克} = 1\\,000 \\text{ 克},", "\\qquad", "1 \\text{ 升} = 100 \\text{ 厘升}.", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g3:measure:mass}", "一封信：约 $20$ 克。一袋面粉：$1$ 千克。一个浴缸：约", "$150$ 升。一只玻璃杯：约 $20$ 厘升。要使秤的一端放着一个", "$1$ 千克的袋子，另一端放 $650$ 克苹果，需在苹果一侧加上 $1\\,000 - 650 = 350$ 克。", "the apples' side.", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{认读钟表}", "", "\\begin{method}[读时间]\\label{met:g3:measure:clock}", "对于带指针的钟表：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 短的\\emph{时针}指示小时：读出它刚刚", "        经过的数字；", "  \\item 长的\\emph{分针}指示分钟：每个大格为 $5$", "        分钟，所以分针指向 $3$ 时表示 $15$ 分钟；", "  \\item 过了半点之后，还可以读作“差……到下一个整点”：", "        $10{:}50$ 读作“差十分十一点”。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  % clock 1: 3:00", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "  \\foreach \\h in {1,...,12} {", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at ({90-\\h*30}:1.05) {\\h};", "    \\draw ({90-\\h*30}:1.22) -- ({90-\\h*30}:1.3);", "  }", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0) -- (0:0.65);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0) -- (90:1.05);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.55) {3:00};", "  % clock 2: 7:30", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.4cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "  \\foreach \\h in {1,...,12} {", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at ({90-\\h*30}:1.05) {\\h};", "    \\draw ({90-\\h*30}:1.22) -- ({90-\\h*30}:1.3);", "  }", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0) -- ({90-7.5*30}:0.65);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0) -- (270:1.05);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.55) {7:30};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % clock 3: 10:50", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.8cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "  \\foreach \\h in {1,...,12} {", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at ({90-\\h*30}:1.05) {\\h};", "    \\draw ({90-\\h*30}:1.22) -- ({90-\\h*30}:1.3);", "  }", "  \\draw[very thick, omDef] (0,0) -- ({90-10.83*30}:0.65);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (0,0) -- ({90-10*30}:1.05);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (0,-1.55) {10:50};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}